            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "gamadmex"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is really more of a crisp than a cobbler. However, the recipe was quite good, and I would definitely make it again. There was none leftover at all.\n\nAs others suggested I did add 2 Tbsp of corn starch and about 1/4 Tsp each of cinnamon and vanilla. I also did a mix of 1/4 C of sugar and 1/4 C of light brown sugar. This combination worked well, and everyone really liked it. There was none left whatsoever.",
            "datePublished": "2016-08-08T00:06:19.817Z"
